  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extractive Industries Accountability and Governance Enhancement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to achieve compliance with the TEITA Act, prepare for validation according to the 2019 EITI standard and to improve the investment climate in the extractive sector by advancing a constructive dialogue on the impacts and benefits of the extractive industries between the Government and the private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
